{"source": "S02", "alias": "评测", "mode": "canonical", "status": "PASS", "calls": 5, "reads": 3, "stop": "submitted", "trajectory": [{"run_id": "steps-6", "step": 1, "call_id": "steps-6:1", "tool": "search_sources", "arguments": {"terms": ["agent", "评估"]}, "decision_note": "先检索相关资料"}, {"run_id": "steps-6", "step": 2, "call_id": "steps-6:2", "tool": "read_source", "arguments": {"source_id": "S01"}, "decision_note": "读取行动策略议题的资料"}, {"run_id": "steps-6", "step": 3, "call_id": "steps-6:3", "tool": "read_source", "arguments": {"source_id": "S02"}, "decision_note": "读取任务完成议题的资料"}, {"run_id": "steps-6", "step": 4, "call_id": "steps-6:4", "tool": "read_source", "arguments": {"source_id": "S03"}, "decision_note": "读取重复可靠性议题的资料"}, {"run_id": "steps-6", "step": 5, "call_id": "steps-6:5", "tool": "write_brief", "arguments": {"markdown": "# 如何评估能调用工具的 Agent\n\n同一个 Agent 的工具调用可以看起来合理，但是否完成任务仍需检查外部结果。下面三个维度分别对应行动过程、任务终态和跨次可靠性。\n\n- **行动策略**　ReAct 将文字推理与工具行动交织，用环境观察更新计划。HotpotQA 精确匹配率为 27.4%，Act 为 25.7%。 [S01 · ReAct · §2、§3.3、表 1](https://arxiv.org/html/2210.03629)\n- **任务完成**　WebArena 在模拟网站中通过功能性检查评估任务。最佳 GPT-4 Agent 的端到端成功率为 14.41%，人类为 78.24%。 [S02 · WebArena · §3、§5、表 2](https://proceedings.iclr.cc/paper_files/paper/2024/file/4410c0711e9154a7a2d26f9b3816d1ef-Paper-Conference.pdf)\n- **重复可靠性**　τ-bench 比对会话结束后的数据库状态，并用 pass^k 衡量 k 次试验均成功的可靠性。论文报告 GPT-4o 的零售 pass^8 低于 25%。 [S03 · τ-bench · §2–3、图 4](https://proceedings.iclr.cc/paper_files/paper/2025/file/1b126cc38b8638e07bef37e7b2bb72bf-Paper-Conference.pdf)\n\n## 对实验设计的启示\n\n先记录可复查的工具与观察，再用独立检查器判定产物。若涉及随机模型，再对同一任务重复运行，报告多次均成功的比例。上述三篇研究的任务和指标各异，百分比仅用于说明各自的结果。\n"}, "decision_note": "把已读证据汇编成简报"}, {"run_id": "steps-6", "event": "stop", "steps_used": 5, "reason": "submitted"}], "observations": [{"run_id": "steps-6", "step": 1, "call_id": "steps-6:1", "tool": "search_sources", "result": {"ok": true, "hits": [{"id": "S01", "topic": "行动策略", "title": "ReAct"}, {"id": "S02", "topic": "任务完成", "title": "WebArena"}, {"id": "S03", "topic": "重复